    "baseline": "FR-26, FR-34, FR-42; SRS (3).docx.\nThi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF x\u1EED l\u00FD chi ti\u1EBFt (1).docx: UC2.3-U16 LopHocService.HuyAsync (b\u1EA3ng 125); UC3.3-U16 BaiTapService.LayAsync (b\u1EA3ng 175); UC4.1-U17 TienDoService.LayAsync (b\u1EA3ng 268); UC5.1-U15 TinNhanService.TheoLopAsync (b\u1EA3ng 301); TV-U05 LopHocController.ChiTiet (b\u1EA3ng 389); TV-U10 LopHocService.ChiTietAsync (b\u1EA3ng 394); TV-U11 LopHocService.LichAsync (b\u1EA3ng 395); TV-U12 LopHocService.LocBuoiAsync (b\u1EA3ng 396); TV-U13 LopHocService.BuoiAsync (b\u1EA3ng 397); TV-U22 LopHocService.DanhGiaDaGuiAsync (b\u1EA3ng 406)\nNh\u00E1nh/kh\u1EDBp n\u1ED1i: Qua gi\u1EDD nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a ghi nh\u1EADn kh\u00F4ng t\u00EDnh \u0111\u00E3 h\u1ECDc",
    "strategy": "Bottom-up, BU3; th\u1EE9 t\u1EF1 ch\u1EA1y #121.\nKi\u1EC3m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc: IT-083, IT-111, IT-157\nGh\u00E9p sau: HTTP \u2192 binding/validation/auth/antiforgery/filter \u2192 TienDoService, LopHocService, BaiTapService, TinNhanService, LopHocController \u2192 EF/SQL Server\nC\u0103n c\u1EE9: Sau Service\u2013DB v\u00E0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp li\u00EAn quan, gh\u00E9p HTTP/MVC \u0111\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m binding, cookie, antiforgery v\u00E0 chuy\u1EC3n k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 th\u00E0nh response. Kh\u00F4ng t\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u \u0111\u00E3 sinh \u1EDF TC ti\u00EAn quy\u1EBFt; m\u1ED7i TC/DL fixture \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp.",
    "conditions": "Fixture F6 \u002B F0; to\u00E0n b\u1ED9 DL d\u00F9ng fixture ri\u00EAng.\nL1 \u0111\u00E3 k\u1EBFt th\u00FAc \u003E24 gi\u1EDD, B1 kh\u00F4ng GhiNhanLuc, kh\u00F4ng ghi DaHoc; worker t\u1EAFt.\nHuy=CancellationToken ri\u00EAng khi method c\u00F3 tham s\u1ED1. RV/stamp/Id l\u1EA5y t\u1EEB fixture th\u1EADt, kh\u00F4ng hard-code gi\u00E1 tr\u1ECB gi\u1EA3.",
    "steps": "1. Ch\u1EA1y tr\u01B0\u1EDBc IT-083, IT-111, IT-157; t\u1EA1o fixture F6 m\u1EDBi v\u00E0 host test tr\u1ECF DB n\u00E0y; ch\u1EC9 t\u1EAFt hai worker khi ca kh\u00F4ng ki\u1EC3m worker.\n2. D\u00F9ng WebApplicationFactory/host th\u1EADt v\u00E0 HttpClient HTTPS ri\u00EAng,AllowAutoRedirect=false. Actor/cookie theo TC; n\u1EBFu c\u00F3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp ph\u1EA3i qua Identity/cookie th\u1EADt, kh\u00F4ng fake authentication handler.\n3. GET form t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng c\u00F9ng client l\u1EA5y cookie CSRF v\u00E0 __RequestVerificationToken. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1ED1 \u00FD b\u1ECF token \u1EDF DL CSRF. Input: L1 \u0111\u00E3 k\u1EBFt th\u00FAc \u003E24 gi\u1EDD, B1 kh\u00F4ng GhiNhanLuc, kh\u00F4ng ghi DaHoc; worker t\u1EAFt.\n4. GET l\u1ECBch v\u00E0 ti\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED9; \u0111\u1ED1i chi\u1EBFu ngu\u1ED3n BuoiHoc/LichHoc. \u0110i\u1EC3m v\u00E0o: GET /HocTap/LopHoc/ChiTiet?id=C1\u0026tab=overview. Nghi\u1EC7p v\u1EE5 d\u00F9ng AJAX; auth form gi\u1EEF form th\u01B0\u1EDDng; multipart \u0111\u00FAng t\u00EAn field khi c\u00F3 file.\n5. Ghi raw status,Content-Type,Location/body tr\u01B0\u1EDBc redirect r\u1ED3i assert contract: 200; B1 l\u00E0 Ch\u01B0a ghi nh\u1EADn; s\u1ED1 bu\u1ED5i \u0111\u00E3 h\u1ECDc kh\u00F4ng t\u0103ng v\u00EC ch\u1EC9 qua gi\u1EDD.\n6. \u0110\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i b\u1EB1ng context/connection \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp; Oracle: SELECT * FROM dbo.LichHoc WHERE LopHocId=@C1; SELECT * FROM dbo.BuoiHoc WHERE LichHocId IN(SELECT Id FROM dbo.LichHoc WHERE LopHocId=@C1); SELECT * FROM dbo.LichSuDieuChinhLich WHERE LichHocId=@L1;\n7. Assert d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u li\u00EAn th\u00F4ng v\u00E0 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u kh\u00F4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED5i: Kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 ghi nh\u1EADn/\u0111i\u1EC3m danh gi\u1EA3; d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ch\u1EDD nh\u1EAFc v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF.\n8. Ghi trace/request/test name v\u00E0 TRX,SQL tr\u01B0\u1EDBc\u2013sau,file hash. D\u1EEBng host/worker,\u0111\u1EE3i k\u1EBFt th\u00FAc scope r\u1ED3i reset fixture/sandbox; kh\u00F4ng ch\u00E9p k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 Pass t\u1EEB b\u1ED9 kh\u00E1c.",
    "expected": "1. Ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i / h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng: 200; B1 l\u00E0 Ch\u01B0a ghi nh\u1EADn; s\u1ED1 bu\u1ED5i \u0111\u00E3 h\u1ECDc kh\u00F4ng t\u0103ng v\u00EC ch\u1EC9 qua gi\u1EDD.\n2. D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\u00E0 side effect: Kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 ghi nh\u1EADn/\u0111i\u1EC3m danh gi\u1EA3; d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ch\u1EDD nh\u1EAFc v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF."
